  "details": "Let's say one or more of your friends are in a world that is not cross platform, thus preventing you both from visiting each other. What if VRChat had a messenger-like feature that lets you send direct messages to friends? This part is optional, but you could also be allowed to share pictures. In general, it would be good for talking to someone who is in a part of VRChat you're unable to visit.",
